# Paths are relative to the repository root, the build context
.git
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
apps/api/src/generated
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.dump
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Dumps in the root only: Prisma migrations must reach the image
*.sql

# Editor and tool folders and dotfiles; .npmrc is the one dotfile the Dockerfile copies
.*
!.npmrc

# Local material that must never reach a build layer
docs
design
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.local.md
